    "title": "pandas.PeriodIndex.dayofyear — pandas 2.2.3 documentation",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# pandas.PeriodIndex.dayofyear#\n\n- \n*property* PeriodIndex.dayofyear[source]#\n- The ordinal day of the year. Examples >>> idx = pd.PeriodIndex([\"2023-01-10\", \"2023-02-01\", \"2023-03-01\"], freq=\"D\") >>> idx.dayofyear Index([10, 32, 60], dtype='int64') >>> idx = pd.PeriodIndex([\"2023\", \"2024\", \"2025\"], freq=\"Y\") >>> idx PeriodIndex(['2023', '2024', '2025'], dtype='period[Y-DEC]') >>> idx.dayofyear Index([365, 366, 365], dtype='int64')",
